==Objectives==
Steal 10 pumpkins from [[Solliden Farmstead|the farm to the west]], just north of [[Deathknell]] and take them to [[Apothecary Johaan]] in [[Brill]]. 
*[[Tirisfal Pumpkin]] (10)

==Description==
What have we here? You look like a fledgling <class>. If you hope to prove yourself to [[Sylvanas Windrunner|The Dark Lady]], you need to learn the ways of The [[Forsaken]].

To the west you'll find a [[farm]]. [[Human]]s infest the land like mold on a rotting corpse. And worse yet, the [[Scarlet Crusade]] patrols nearby from [[Crusader's Outpost|their tower]]. Teach those scum a lesson and steal 10 of their precious pumpkins.

Once you have 10, take them to Apothecary Johaan in Brill.

